ID: B3-Ch04b-Beg3
TEXT:

 "You'll do anything?" I ask Billy Bob. "Then how about you give me full control of all the devices in Ollendor? You should be able to do that, right?"

"Yes! Yes, of course!" Billy Bob babbles, sweat dripping down his nose. "There's an override panel underneath the center bench. You input the master cipher, and it grants full administrative access. Come here—step around the side, and I'll give you the sequence."

"Is he telling the truth?" I ask Leila.

"I can't tell," Leila writes in floating blue script. "His fear has shredded his aura. The flow is completely erratic."

choice("Go to the table.", B3-Ch04b-Beg4, v_current_scene = B3-Ch04b-Beg4, v_b3_ch4_beg = 3)
