TEXT:

 "Focus fire on their shields while they're stunned!" I shout. "Wear them down!"

"If you say so," Kate mutters.

Kate, Flower, Illuna, and Breynan unleash a sustained barrage of fire, ice, and light. The drones absorb the impacts without moving, but after five seconds of relentless pounding, their orange optics begin to strobe violently in high-pitched, harmonic pulses.

"Warning," all four units announce in flat synthetic unison. "Barrier integrity critical. Initiating self-destruct sequence."

"Barrier, now!" Breynan screams.

The four chassis detonate simultaneously in a concussive firestorm that obliterates the gallery and everything in it.

